Changes from 0.10.2 to 0.10.3 - released 2026-10-22

Renamed: the Composer package is `se7enxweb/ggsysinfo`. Before 0.10.3 it was published as `gggeek/ggsysinfo`, the
  name of the original package, which Packagist builds from the original author's repository, so the maintained
  releases could not be installed under it. composer.json declares `"replace": {"gggeek/ggsysinfo": "self.version"}`,
  so the two names are never installed side by side

Improved: README.md uses the new name in every install and upgrade command and explains how to switch:
  `composer remove gggeek/ggsysinfo && composer require se7enxweb/ggsysinfo`, or change the require line

No code or settings changed.
